  unitName: Wave Breaker Quartz
  unitId: 20646
  unitNumber: 1044
  description: The disciple who discovered the power of the Nine Sacred Treasures.
    After Quartz imbued the Sacred Treasures with mysterious powers, they began to
    grow with the help of the demonic power found in the lands of Ishgria. Using
    these powers Quartz was able to return home, promptly renaming all the treasures
    again and scattering them across Grand Gaia. It is said he told every human who
    received one to keep the existence of their respective treasure a secret, but
    the reason for this remains unclear. It wasn't until some of the treasure bearers
    began speaking of the sacred items he had named and left behind that their history
    resurfaced.
  summonDesc: My intentions aren't bad.<br>But treasure drives men mad.<br>It must
    be strictly regulated.
  fusionDesc: Fusion is quite handy.<br>However, it still can't be compared<br>to
    the power of the Sacred Treasures.
  evoDesc: So the treasures evolved too?<br>I guess I should thank you<br>for helping
    me evolve as well.
  element: 2
  rarity: 6
